{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22041","headline":"青冢 · 白居易","name":"青冢","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上有饥鹰号，下有枯蓬走。\n茫茫边雪里，一掬沙培塿。\n传是昭君墓，埋闭蛾眉久。\n凝脂化爲泥，铅黛复何有。\n唯有阴怨气，时生坟左右。\n郁郁如苦雾，不随骨销朽。\n妇人无他才，荣枯系妍否。\n何乃明妃命，独悬画工手。\n丹青一诖误，白黑相纷纠。\n遂使君眼中，西施作嫫母。\n同侪倾宠幸，异类爲配偶。\n祸福安可知，美颜不如丑。\n何言一时事，可戒千年後。\n特报後来姝，不须倚眉首。\n无辞插荆钗，嫁作贫家妇。\n不见青冢上，行人爲浇酒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22041.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22041","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}